<section class="core-problem">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      The World Is Fragmented. Energy Is Centralized.<br/>
      <span class="highlight">People Are Disconnected.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="problems-grid">
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="card-label">Energy Infrastructure</div>
        <p class="card-intro">Energy infrastructure is broken.</p>
        <p class="card-text">Renewable energy adoption is constrained not by demand, but by:</p>
        <ul class="problem-list">
          <li>Fragmented stakeholders</li>
          <li>Poor coordination between customers, installers, distributors, and capital</li>
          <li>Lack of scalable platforms that unify the ecosystem</li>
          <li>Centralized utilities that resist decentralization</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="card-label">Human Crisis</div>
        <p class="card-intro">Modern lifestyles are failing.</p>
        <p class="card-text">At the same time, modern lifestyles are driving:</p>
        <ul class="problem-list">
          <li>Chronic disease</li>
          <li>Environmental degradation</li>
          <li>Loss of meaning, ritual, and community</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conclusion">
      <p>These are not separate problems.</p>
      <p class="accent">They require a unified solution.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .core-problem {
    padding: 100px 24px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .problems-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .problem-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
  }

  .card-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .card-intro {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .problem-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .problem-list li {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .problem-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  .conclusion {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .conclusion p {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .conclusion .accent {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .core-problem {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .problems-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .problem-card {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
